        "cooked": "<p>A Prince from Aeternus becomes a Scion of OblivAeon</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-324-writers-room-fanatic-vol-2-173-an-ternal-prince-as-a-scion\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-324-writers-room-fanatic-vol-2-173-an-ternal-prince-as-a-scion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-324-writers-room-fanatic-vol-2-173-an-ternal-prince-as-a-scion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #324 - Writers' Room: Fanatic Vol. 2 #173 \"An...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>From Prince to Scion? What a terrible road!  Show Notes: Run Time: 2:08:37 We tell you a story, create a character, tell more story, and make up and/or reveal more details! And then, following the standard pattern, we read and answer your letters!...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8c4ccefb56fa798033d41df982e3acd24aead1ab.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/8c4ccefb56fa798033d41df982e3acd24aead1ab\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8c4ccefb56fa798033d41df982e3acd24aead1ab_2_329x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"k19pfUax8KHPeiEnrTKc9PGow5R\" width=\"329\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8c4ccefb56fa798033d41df982e3acd24aead1ab_2_329x500.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8c4ccefb56fa798033d41df982e3acd24aead1ab_2_493x750.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8c4ccefb56fa798033d41df982e3acd24aead1ab_2_658x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"AC8D77\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2696×4088 3.35 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
