        "raw": "Got to listen to most of this at home!\n\nAdam and I had the same idea at the start of the episode. :D\n\nThe moment she called Painstake her daughter, I immediately began thinking of Ashdia as \"Momstake\" XD\n\nWow, Darkstrife and Painstake fighting *again?* It's like a two-for-one!\n\nLove this musical interlude.\n\nOh, so that's what Betrayer Painstake's deal is! We need to do more topics based on new DE cards.\n\nSushi?! What happened to the sandwich bag??\n\nI don't often say this, but this has been a fantastic letters section!\n\nGod, and this episode has somehow given me TWO ideas for villains. Literally how.\n\nLooking at the image of Ashdia as they describe her, yeah, this is a really awesome looking character.\n\nOoh, I also was once a Prairie Home Companion enjoyer. Anyway, also loving this outro, this has been an all-around great episode. :D",
