        "id": 265872,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-07-16T00:11:54.856Z",
        "cooked": "<p>“The Autoverse is Transformers”.  Dude, there’s literally a movie called Cars.  No alien robots necessary.</p>\n<p>Vainglory isn’t pride, it’s specifically prideful <em>boasting</em>, or just boasting in general.  It doesn’t mean YOU think highly of yourself, it means you want others to think you’re great, so you’re lying through your teeth.  It relates to Pride very similarly to how Envy relates to Greed.</p>\n<p>Argh, lost my pause point.  Neither of these was among the two big points I want to speak on, so I’ll be back on yet another day, after listening to this episode’s first half for a third time.  It has been among my favorites, but I wonder how long it can stay that way.</p>",
