        "created_at": "2026-07-18T00:27:23.481Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Or the Putt Putt games.  Anyway, attempt three here to remember my two big points.</p>\n<p>Ashtia is a pretty good name, but I feel like they could have used the sin’s original name, Tristitia, that would have sounded pretty demony.</p>\n<p>Great, now I’ve forgotten <em>three</em> things I intended to say.  At least I’m pretty sure the third one is minor.</p>\n<p>Okay, officially giving up.  I had vague beginnings of a few points several times, but no concrete recollection of what I thought of to say while first listening.  At least one was about Grimm I think, because he’s one of the topics I fixate on the most, but I don’t recall the details for sure.  Three listens through the entire episode in a week are more than though; I gotta move on.</p>",
